      children: "These code examples demonstrate the core patterns: type-safe event schemas, server-side processing with privacy controls, efficient warehouse loading, and SQL-based identity resolution. Production implementations would add error handling, monitoring, schema validation, and retry logic, but these foundations remain consistent across different technology stacks."
    }), "\n", _jsx(_components.h2, {
